{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nn, mod = map(int, input().split())\n\nmemo_f = {}\nmemo_t = {}\n\ndef F(N, k):\n    key = (N, k)\n    if key in memo_f:\n        return memo_f[key]\n\n    if N == 1:\n        res = 1 if k < 0 else 0\n        memo_f[key] = res\n        return res\n\n    inv = N * (N - 1) // 2\n\n    if k < -inv - 1:\n        res = F(N, -inv - 1)\n        memo_f[key] = res\n        return res\n\n    if k >= inv:\n        memo_f[key] = 0\n        return 0\n\n    res = 0\n    for d in range(-N + 1, N):\n        res = (res + F(N - 1, k - d) * min(N - d, d + N)) % mod\n\n    memo_f[key] = res\n    return res\n\ndef T(N, k):\n    key = (N, k)\n    if key in memo_t:\n        return memo_t[key]\n\n    if N == 1:\n        memo_t[key] = -1\n        return -1\n\n    inv = N * (N - 1) // 2\n\n    if k < -inv - 1:\n        res = T(N, -inv - 1)\n        memo_t[key] = res\n        return res\n\n    if k >= inv:\n        memo_t[key] = 0\n        return 0\n\n    res = 0\n    for d in range(-N + 1, 1):\n        child = T if d == 0 else F\n        res = (res + child(N - 1, k - d) * min(N - d, d + N)) % mod\n\n    memo_t[key] = res\n    return res\n\nprint(T(n, 0) % mod)\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\ntypedef long long ll;\nint mod;\nmap<pair<int,int>, ll> memo_f, memo_t;\n\nll F(int N, int k);\nll T(int N, int k);\n\nll F(int N, int k) {\n    auto key = make_pair(N, k);\n    if (memo_f.count(key)) return memo_f[key];\n    if (N == 1) {\n        ll res = (k < 0) ? 1 : 0;\n        memo_f[key] = res;\n        return res;\n    }\n    int inv = N * (N - 1) / 2;\n    if (k < -inv - 1) {\n        ll res = F(N, -inv - 1);\n        memo_f[key] = res;\n        return res;\n    }\n    if (k >= inv) {\n        memo_f[key] = 0;\n        return 0;\n    }\n    ll res = 0;\n    for (int d = -N + 1; d < N; ++d) {\n        int weight = min(N - d, d + N);\n        ll child = F(N - 1, k - d);\n        ll term = (child % mod + mod) % mod * weight % mod;\n        res = (res + term) % mod;\n    }\n    memo_f[key] = res;\n    return res;\n}\n\nll T(int N, int k) {\n    auto key = make_pair(N, k);\n    if (memo_t.count(key)) return memo_t[key];\n    if (N == 1) {\n        memo_t[key] = -1;\n        return -1;\n    }\n    int inv = N * (N - 1) / 2;\n    if (k < -inv - 1) {\n        ll res = T(N, -inv - 1);\n        memo_t[key] = res;\n        return res;\n    }\n    if (k >= inv) {\n        memo_t[key] = 0;\n        return 0;\n    }\n    ll res = 0;\n    for (int d = -N + 1; d <= 0; ++d) {\n        ll child_val;\n        if (d == 0) {\n            child_val = T(N - 1, k - d);\n        } else {\n            child_val = F(N - 1, k - d);\n        }\n        int weight = min(N - d, d + N);\n        ll term = (child_val % mod + mod) % mod * weight % mod;\n        res = (res + term) % mod;\n    }\n    memo_t[key] = res;\n    return res;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int n;\n    cin >> n >> mod;\n    ll ans = T(n, 0) % mod;\n    if (ans < 0) an